# Game lokal tidak memerlukan akun, server aplikasi, atau kredensial.
# Workflow manual GitHub memakai environment itch-ternak-zombie:
# Variable ITCH_TARGET = username-itch/slug-game
# Secret BUTLER_API_KEY = API key itch.io (jangan commit nilainya)
# Opsional untuk QA browser lokal:
# PLAYWRIGHT_MODULE = path absolut entry module Playwright
# PLAYWRIGHT_EXECUTABLE = path absolut executable Chromium
